## 1. Project Overview

The AI Student Learning and Career Success Platform is designed to help students improve their technical knowledge, practise skills, track learning progress and prepare for career opportunities.

The platform provides separate features for three main users:

- Admin
- Trainer
- Student

Each user has different responsibilities and dashboard features.

## 2. Week 2 Goal

The main goal of Week 2 is to develop the main application screens, connect the frontend with the database and backend services, add Generative AI features and test the application.

